/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:392: - [fusion] `logs/query_log.sql` no longer loses the SQL statement: multi-line adapter errors now carry the `--` comment marker on every line instead of leaking DuckDB's candidate-bindings/`LINE n: ... ^` excerpt as bare SQL, and entries are separated by a blank line so a statement no longer butts against the next entry's `created_at:` header
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:514: - [fusion] Fix `dbt lint --fix` reporting rule violations (e.g. CV02, AL09, CV10) that live entirely inside a Jinja macro-expanded region -- these are correctly suppressed under plain `dbt lint`, but leaked through under `--fix` with positions pointing into the rendered SQL instead of the source, and could never actually be fixed
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:530: - [dbt-core] BigQuery unit tests no longer leak pseudocolumns ([#15357](https://github.com/dbt-labs/dbt-core/issues/15357))
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:646: - [fusion] Generic tests now accept a sequence-valued column_name property (e.g. unique: {column_name: [a, b]}), forwarding it as a macro kwarg. A model-level test's column_name kwarg no longer leaks into the test node's own column_name, which names the column the test is attached to and stays null for model-level tests, matching dbt Core (#13607)
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:659: - [fusion] Fix double focus-ring on the search input (missing appearance-none was letting the browser's native <input type=search> decoration leak through)
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:1269: - [fusion] Treat parse-time adapter.get_relation results as none in Jinja control flow so unreachable branches do not leak test configuration.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-030/dbt-core/CHANGELOG-dbt.md:1974: - [fusion] Stop /api/v1/health from leaking the absolute index_dir path; replace with project_loaded + generation (snapshot timestamp) and an X-Docs-Generation header
