162:By default, `dbt deps` "pins" each package. See ["Pinning packages"](#pinning-packages) for details.
458:Running [`dbt deps`](/reference/commands/deps) "pins" each package by creating or updating the `package-lock.yml` file in the _project_root_ where `packages.yml` is recorded. 
460:- The `package-lock.yml` file contains a record of all packages installed.
461:- If subsequent `dbt deps` runs contain no changes to `dependencies.yml` or `packages.yml`, dbt installs from `package-lock.yml`. 
463:For example, if you use a branch name, the `package-lock.yml` file pins to the head commit. If you use a version range, it pins to the latest release. In either case, subsequent commits or versions will **not** be installed. To get new commits or versions, run `dbt deps --upgrade` or add `package-lock.yml` to your .gitignore file.
